---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import PhoneCTA from '../../components/PhoneCTA.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../components/QuoteForm.astro';
import SchemaMarkup from '../../components/SchemaMarkup.astro';
import { config } from '../../config';

const title = 'Nanaimo to Parksville & Qualicum Courier';
const description = 'Same-day courier from Nanaimo to Parksville, Qualicum Beach. 45 minutes delivery. Tourism, retail, seasonal services.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <SchemaMarkup type="Service" data={{ serviceName: 'Nanaimo to Parksville Route', description }} />

  <PageHero
    word="Parksville"
    eyebrow="Nanaimo → Parksville"
    description="Quick same-day courier to Parksville and Qualicum Beach — 30–45 minute delivery for retail, tourism, and seasonal events."
  />

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Nanaimo ↔ Parksville/Qualicum Route Details</h2>

    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded mb-8">
      <h3 class="font-bold mb-4 text-brand-blue">Quick Facts</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 text-sm">
        <li><strong>Distance:</strong> ~30 km via Highway 19 South</li>
        <li><strong>Drive time:</strong> 30 minutes direct</li>
        <li><strong>Total typical:</strong> 45 minutes to 1 hour door-to-door</li>
        <li><strong>Traffic:</strong> Minimal. Summer tourism can add 5–10 minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Cost:</strong> $18 base + $1.50/km = ~$63 typical</li>
        <li><strong>Best for:</strong> Fastest turnaround on Vancouver Island</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 section-container">
    <h2>Same-Day Cutoff: Parksville & Qualicum</h2>

    <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Parksville/Qualicum</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-blue font-semibold">3:00 PM cutoff (weekdays)</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-1">Order by 3 PM, delivery by 4–4:30 PM. Fastest turn-around on the island.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Friday</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-blue font-semibold">2:00 PM cutoff</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mt-1">Plan ahead for Friday. Weekend delivery not guaranteed until Monday.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Evenings & Weekends</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
          Call for availability. Same 45-minute route works after hours with rush surcharge.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Common Nanaimo ↔ Parksville Scenarios</h2>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-blue bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Retail Document Delivery</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Parksville mall retail: urgent price list updates, marketing materials, inventory docs. Order by 2 PM, delivery by 3:30 PM. Cost: ~$63 standard.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-blue bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Tourism & Hospitality</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Hotel/resort courier: guest documents, conference materials, event logistics. Tourism season (May–Sept) high volume; book early. Same-day by 4 PM guaranteed before 2 PM order.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-blue bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Medical Clinic Specimen</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Parksville clinic → Nanaimo lab: blood draw at 2 PM, pickup by 2:30 PM, lab delivery by 3:30 PM. Cost: $63 + temperature control surcharge ($5–$10).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 section-container">
    <h2>Parksville/Qualicum Pricing & Cost Examples</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Parksville is the shortest route on Vancouver Island. Fastest turnaround, lowest cost.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded border border-gray-300 mb-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="pb-4 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Standard Same-Day Rate</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$18 base + (30 km × $1.50) = <span class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue">$63</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">One of the cheapest courier runs on the island. High-frequency drivers (multiple daily runs to Parksville).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-4 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Temperature Control (Medical)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$63 + $5–$10 (ice packs) = <span class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue">$68–$73</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Common for clinic specimen runs. Example: Parksville clinic → Nanaimo lab.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pb-4 border-b">
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Rush Multiplier (After 2 PM)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$63 × 1.5 = <span class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue">~$95</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Urgent order after cutoff. Drivers usually available due to frequent route traffic.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Multi-Stop (Retail Circuit)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">$18 × 3 stops + (30 km × $1.50) = <span class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue">$99</span></p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Parksville mall + downtown + Qualicum Beach delivery. Single route, single invoice.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
        High-volume Parksville account? Fixed weekly rates ($150–$200/run) available. Tourism operators often use standing orders.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container">
    <h2>Parksville Route FAQ</h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 max-w-3xl">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Summer tourism season: Is service available?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes. May–September sees higher demand. We run multiple daily loops. Order by 2 PM weekdays for same-day. Weekend demand is high; confirm availability for Sat/Sun.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Can I deliver to multiple Parksville locations in one pickup?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes. Parksville mall + downtown + resort area = one route. Multi-stop pricing: $5 per additional stop after first delivery. Saves you time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">What if Highway 19 is backed up due to traffic?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Parksville traffic (especially summer) can add 10–15 minutes. We monitor traffic and may adjust timing slightly. You're notified if delay expected. Rush orders get priority lane-switching.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Can I use you for daily retail delivery service?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes. Daily 3 PM Parksville run available at monthly rate (~$150–$200/run, 30–50% cheaper than ad-hoc). Ideal for retail chains, hotel chains, or tourism operators.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <QuoteForm />
</BaseLayout>
